@gateway = http://localhost:5000/gateway/dcs-game
@token = replace-with-game-access-token
@playerId = 1
@heroId = 1

### Highest historical default-formation power
GET {{gateway}}/leaderboards?type=power&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lifetime diamonds spent (not wallet balance)
GET {{gateway}}/leaderboards?type=diamonds-spent&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inspect a player's current formation
GET {{gateway}}/leaderboards/players/{{playerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inspect one hero in that formation
GET {{gateway}}/leaderboards/players/{{playerId}}/heroes/{{heroId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid category: 400
GET {{gateway}}/leaderboards?type=wallet-balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown player: 404
GET {{gateway}}/leaderboards/players/9223372036854775807
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unauthenticated: 401
GET {{gateway}}/leaderboards
